WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.250
How layers build up at a site.

2
00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:06.652
At a site, layers of soil and rubbish build up over time.

3
00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:10.385
Layer A goes down first.

4
00:00:12.344 --> 00:00:14.594
Then layer B goes on top of it.

5
00:00:16.735 --> 00:00:19.860
Then layer C. The top layer is the youngest.

6
00:00:21.676 --> 00:00:25.176
Later, someone digs a pit down through the layers into A.

7
00:00:26.452 --> 00:00:30.302
The coin in the pit is deep, but it is younger than those layers.
